==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is an [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]].
*5 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Zackie Peng]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawns as the boss.
**8 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
**3 [[Zackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 43.33~50 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,500f</sup>.
**2 [[Zigge]]s spawn, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is optimized for level 5 units. If you struggle, it may be worth waiting for earlier stages to become available and clearing those first.

Although this stage has [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]], it is not too difficult to charge ahead. Bring [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Macho Cat]], [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]], [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Wall Cat]], [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]] and [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|The Flying Cat]] (or [[Crazed Bird Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed UFO Cat]]). Once the enemies reach the [[Cat Base]], spam Flying Cats, then everything once your stack starts pushing. A small army will push ahead and destroy the enemy base, while a second line will form from revived Zombies. If the first army fails, you'll just be able to try the same thing again. This can even work with level 2 units.

